{"id":"a70a5d6332c520c80d02adb23a0731c3b4a25eb3","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229985","title":"codex 客户端的推理强度最后两个（最高&极高）啥区别","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"v2dev","excerpt":"OpenAI - @v2dev - https://i.imgur.com/BWZqEAV.png 第一个极高应该是 XHigh ，那最高和最下面的极高是啥，实测在 sub2api 中显示的都是 MAX ，不知道有什么区别","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/BWZqEAV.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BWZqEAV.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>第一个极高应该是 XHigh ，那最高和最下面的极高是啥，实测在 sub2api 中显示的都是 MAX ，不知道有什么区别</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/推理\"><li></li> 推理</a><a href=\"/tag/强度\"><li></li> 强度</a><a href=\"/tag/区别\"><li></li> 区别</a></P><p><span>20 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-27 18:41:55 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17905742\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/326b525245435e15befb7f38bce37ba9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mooyo\" data-uid=\"401342\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mooyo\">mooyo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 07:59:38 +08:00\">22h 26m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>ultra = max + subagent 。 </p><p>ultra 是一个客户端行为，会被本地映射到 max</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17905749\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/804d/e559/351325_normal.png?m=1753865514\" alt=\"qwwuyu\" data-uid=\"351325\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qwwuyu\">qwwuyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 08:11:12 +08:00\">22h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>貌似就是显示 BUG</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17905810\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/063a/2a6f/259411_normal.png?m=1751099173\" alt=\"version\" data-uid=\"259411\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/version\">version</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 08:48:56 +08:00\">21h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>日常用 极高 标准速度就好...和 5.5 的一样消耗.正常些代码吧..现在 5.6 都是一样慢..多几个项目一起开发咯.....如果要重置开最底下的极高.再开极速模式.它会每次创建一堆子智能体来并发..这样周限额可以当 5 小时额度使用......高档位 20x 都开不起的..周额度很快就见底了..</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17905878\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7f7f/3bb4/531733_normal.png?m=1784862706\" alt=\"JoeJoeJoe\" data-uid=\"531733\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JoeJoeJoe\">JoeJoeJoe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 09:06:09 +08:00\">21h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>最后那个极高就是 ultra</p><p>不算是推理强度其实, 他是开很多个使用 Max 推理强度的 agent 来并行任务, 目前感觉蠢的一批, 而且是额度杀手.</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906002\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/891f/c90e/499149_normal.png?m=1783070382\" alt=\"calvinHxx\" data-uid=\"499149\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/calvinHxx\">calvinHxx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 09:27:10 +08:00\">20h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有条件最好用 max, max 智商是最在线的 和 xhigh 比是质变唯一没被降低 juice 值的 代价就是随着推理深度提高速度慢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906442\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/728f79a3e4d0f9dbea68ce6cbcf36772?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"tylearymf\" data-uid=\"620695\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tylearymf\">tylearymf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 10:28:56 +08:00\">19h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 max ，max 的 juice 是 960 ，xhigh 的 juice 是 128</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906567\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/891f/c90e/499149_normal.png?m=1783070382\" alt=\"calvinHxx\" data-uid=\"499149\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/calvinHxx\">calvinHxx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 10:47:10 +08:00\">19h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/tylearymf\">tylearymf</a> 没用过 terra 、sol, 模型底层结构不一样吧。比如 opus5max 比 sonnet5 要聪明的吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906604\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4def/89b2/489500_normal.png?m=1664097553\" alt=\"pusheax\" data-uid=\"489500\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pusheax\">pusheax</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 10:52:59 +08:00\">19h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Ultra 极其烧 token ，感觉比 max 翻倍有余。<br>而且貌似会因过度思考，反而降低智商。<br>例如做代码审计时，会提出一些过于刁钻而不存在实际影响的问题。<br>reddit 上看到有相关的吐槽来着。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906734\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2bab/68d1/94016_normal.png?m=1777470658\" alt=\"greyfreedom\" data-uid=\"94016\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/greyfreedom\">greyfreedom</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 11:12:53 +08:00\">19h 12m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>为啥我的没有最高，只有两个极高？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17907301\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/326b525245435e15befb7f38bce37ba9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mooyo\" data-uid=\"401342\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mooyo\">mooyo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 13:19:50 +08:00\">17h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/shilianmlxg\">shilianmlxg</a> 应该是 max ，我改某个中转站代码的时候看了一眼 codex 的代码，里面内部映射是 max</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17907426\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/34a53659ea4aaf4c5e65aab2704bbc26?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiaodi666\" data-uid=\"526191\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaodi666\">xiaodi666</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 13:41:08 +08:00\">16h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最新版 codex 是不是有 bug ？今天更新后经常“当前会话没有提供终端或文件读取工具”。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"第一个极高应该是 XHigh ，那最高和最下面的极高是啥，实测在 sub2api 中显示的都是 MAX ，不知道有什么区别 推理 强度 区别20 replies • 2026-07-27 18:41:55 +08:00 1 mooyo 22h 26m ago 1 ultra = max + subagent 。 ultra 是一个客户端行为，会被本地映射到 max 2 qwwuyu 22h 14m ago 貌似就是显示 BUG 3 version 21h 36m ago 日常用 极高 标准速度就好...和 5.5 的一样消耗.正常些代码吧..现在 5.6 都是一样慢..多几个项目一起开发咯.....如果要重置开最底下的极高.再开极速模式.它会每次创建一堆子智能体来并发..这样周限额可以当 5 小时额度使用......高档位 20x 都开不起的..周额度很快就见底了.. 4 JoeJoeJoe PRO 21h 19m ago 最后那个极高就是 ultra不算是推理强度其实, 他是开很多个使用 Max 推理强度的 agent 来并行任务, 目前感觉蠢的一批, 而且是额度杀手. 6 calvinHxx 20h 58m ago 有条件最好用 max, max 智商是最在线的 和 xhigh 比是质变唯一没被降低 juice 值的 代价就是随着推理深度提高速度慢 8 tylearymf 